Fix two admin UI bugs: Copy button and Inspector link

1. CopyButton: navigator.clipboard.writeText() silently fails in many
   contexts (non-secure origin, inside modals, after navigation). Added
   textarea+execCommand fallback so copy works everywhere.

2. View in Inspector: was incorrectly passing the user's email instead
   of their device ID. Now correctly passes:
   premiumBoundDeviceId → premiumLastSeenDeviceId → email → userId.
   This opens the Device Inspector pre-filled with the actual device ID.
